{"id": "earth-en-1", "text": "Earth is the third planet from the Sun.", "source": "earth-en", "page": 1, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-or-1", "text": "ପୃଥିବୀ ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟଠାରୁ ତୃତୀୟ ଗ୍ରହ।", "source": "earth-or", "page": 1, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-en-2", "text": "Earth takes 365.25 days to complete one orbit around the Sun.", "source": "earth-en", "page": 2, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-or-2", "text": "ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟ ଚାରିପାଖରେ ଥରେ ପରିକ୍ରମା କରିବା ପାଇଁ ପୃଥିବୀକୁ ୩୬୫.୨୫ ଦିନ ଲାଗେ।", "source": "earth-or", "page": 2, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-en-3", "text": "The global ocean covers about 71 percent of Earth's surface.", "source": "earth-en", "page": 3, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-or-3", "text": "ପୃଥିବୀ ପୃଷ୍ଠର ପ୍ରାୟ ୭୧ ପ୍ରତିଶତ ଅଂଶ ସମୁଦ୍ରରେ ଆଚ୍ଛାଦିତ।", "source": "earth-or", "page": 3, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-en-4", "text": "Earth completes one rotation in about 23.9 hours.", "source": "earth-en", "page": 4, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "earth-or-4", "text": "ପୃଥିବୀ ପ୍ରାୟ ୨୩.୯ ଘଣ୍ଟାରେ ନିଜ ଅକ୍ଷ ଚାରିପାଖରେ ଥରେ ଘୂରେ।", "source": "earth-or", "page": 4, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"}
{"id": "moon-en-1", "text": "The Moon is Earth's only natural satellite.", "source": "moon-en", "page": 1, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/"}
{"id": "moon-or-1", "text": "ଚନ୍ଦ୍ର ପୃଥିବୀର ଏକମାତ୍ର ପ୍ରାକୃତିକ ଉପଗ୍ରହ।", "source": "moon-or", "page": 1, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/"}
{"id": "moon-en-2", "text": "The Moon is about 385,000 kilometers from Earth.", "source": "moon-en", "page": 2, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/"}
{"id": "moon-or-2", "text": "ଚନ୍ଦ୍ର ପୃଥିବୀଠାରୁ ପ୍ରାୟ ୩୮୫,୦୦୦ କିଲୋମିଟର ଦୂରରେ ଅଛି।", "source": "moon-or", "page": 2, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/moon/facts/"}
{"id": "sun-en-1", "text": "The Sun is a star at the center of our solar system.", "source": "sun-en", "page": 1, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/"}
{"id": "sun-or-1", "text": "ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟ ଆମ ସୌରମଣ୍ଡଳର କେନ୍ଦ୍ରରେ ଥିବା ଏକ ନକ୍ଷତ୍ର।", "source": "sun-or", "page": 1, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/"}
{"id": "sun-en-2", "text": "The Sun's gravity holds our solar system together.", "source": "sun-en", "page": 2, "language": "en", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/"}
{"id": "sun-or-2", "text": "ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟର ମହାକର୍ଷଣ ଶକ୍ତି ଆମ ସୌରମଣ୍ଡଳକୁ ଏକତ୍ର ବାନ୍ଧି ରଖେ।", "source": "sun-or", "page": 2, "language": "or", "source_url": "https://science.nasa.gov/sun/facts/"}
